Preserve upstream fixes from the former knro/LimeSuite 25.12.03 source.

Generated from upstream v23.11.0 (c2d9e87754586304577beff4dc5b16fb9b72c826)
to 524cd2e548b11084e6f739b2dfe0f958c2e30354, the upstream parent of that fork.
This retains the existing hardware, CMake and C23 fixes, without the fork's
unnecessary CMake minimum-version increase from 3.10 to 3.15.

Upstream comparison:
https://github.com/myriadrf/LimeSuite/compare/c2d9e87754586304577beff4dc5b16fb9b72c826...524cd2e548b11084e6f739b2dfe0f958c2e30354

Revisit/remove this backport when a newer upstream release includes it.

